# Keep images small and state out of build contexts.
.git
data/
logs/
# KEEP THIS. reports/factory/registry.jsonl is tracked and the sandbox DOES need it
# (WeatherBot._registry_status gates paper mode on a family's CURRENT status), but it
# must never be baked in: an image is a build-time snapshot, and a family closed after
# the build would still read PROPOSED. deploy/pi/docker-compose.yml bind-mounts the
# live tracked reports/factory read-only instead. Un-ignoring this is not a fix.
reports/
review_2026_07_24/
vm_snapshot_2026_08_22/
agent_space/
.agent/
.claude/
.gemini/
.env
*.key
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
